          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li>🧪 <strong>Measures Volume</strong></li>
            <li>How much space an object occupies</li>
            <li>1 L = 1,000 ml</li>
            <li>1 L = 0.264 US gallons</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
